    table_icon_custom_placeholder: "✏️ Other - type any emoji",
    table_select_option_delete_confirm: "This option is used in {count} rows. Delete it? Those cells will be emptied.",
    table_select_option_delete_title: "Delete option",
    faq_a_other_manual_option: "Wherever you choose from a list of options, there is also '✏️ Other' - pick it and type exactly what you need. In a table with a choice column (for example 'Relation' in a gift table), tap the cell, choose '✏️ Other', type the value (for example 'Nephew') and tap Add - it is saved as a new option of that column, so next time it is already in the list. The small × next to each option in that list deletes the option from the column. When choosing a table icon there are many icons (including coloured sticky notes), and any emoji can also be typed. It works the same way for saved-meal categories, recipe categories, recurring-expense categories (saved as a new personal category) and goal categories in My Goals.",
