    faq_a_receipts_total: "On the Tax Invoice / Receipt screen, tap 🧮 'Total of all receipts'. Choose from which year to which year (it starts from your oldest receipt to this year), tap Calculate, and you'll see the total of both categories together - Home expenses and Business expenses - plus how many receipts there are and the total of each category separately.",
    faq_q_receipts_total: "How do I add up all my receipts for a period?",
