    receipts_total_tile: "Total of all receipts",
    faq_a_quick_note_apple: "The 🍎 next to 📝 and 🛒 in the notes window is a shortcut for quickly logging one of your saved meals to today's Daily Meal Tracker. It's on by default - if you don't need it, turn it off in Settings > Personalization & Calendar ('Show the 🍎 saved-meal shortcut in the notes window'), and turn it back on there anytime.",
    faq_q_quick_note_apple: "What is the 🍎 in the notes window, and can I hide it?",
    settings_quick_note_apple_label: "Show the 🍎 saved-meal shortcut in the notes window",
    faq_a_vision_board_today: "On the back of a goal card in My Goals, tap 📅 next to a step and pick a date. You can also turn on '🔁 Every week until done' – then it comes back every week on the same day until you tick it once. The step appears on that day in A Peek at Today and in the calendar (and in Google Calendar, if it's connected), and the button shows when it's scheduled. A ✓ in either place ticks the other and updates the goal's progress. Tap 📅 again to change the date or remove it from the calendar. Deleting a one-time task from the calendar also deletes the step from the goal; deleting one week of a weekly reminder removes only that week.",
    faq_q_vision_board_today: "How do I put a goal step in the calendar (📅)?",
    vision_milestone_already_today: "This step is already in today's tasks.",
    auth_consent_required: "To sign up, please confirm the Terms of Use and the Privacy Policy.",
