    nm_disclaimer_p4: "4. Limitation of liability. Use of the program is at the user's own risk. The app's developers and operators shall not be liable for any direct or indirect damage, to health or otherwise, arising from the use of the program, its menus, or the calorie and protein values shown, which are approximate estimates only.",
    nm_disclaimer_p3: "3. Not intended without medical approval for: pregnant or breastfeeding women, minors under the age of 18, anyone with a current or past eating disorder, anyone with a chronic or background medical condition (including diabetes, heart, kidney or liver disease), or anyone taking regular medication – unless explicit approval has been obtained from a treating physician.",
    nm_disclaimer_p2: "2. Choice of plan. Selecting the 1,300-calorie or the 1,500-calorie plan is done at the user's sole discretion and responsibility. Consulting a physician or clinical dietitian before starting any calorie-restricted diet is recommended.",
